9-4e99-4c7c-ab59-a877252576fa","type":"message","user":"U011FTGJ3SN","text":"チートデイ、毎日がチートデイになりそう","ts":"1624338513.486300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"jHj"}]},{"client_msg_id":"64493CF4-293A-4D73-ACA8-C1CAD2FB59E6","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"食事量減らしてるけど停滞期入ったっぽくて、今日チートデイした","ts":"1624335177.485700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"dzrrl"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f3c2344d-1d79-4723-9e2e-1d5413711182","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"でも僕食事制限はしてないな。","ts":"1624335042.484800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Hg9Pq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fb6b3ddb-e9e3-4bfd-a863-4a7c5bdc26ab","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"3か月で累計 39531kcal 消費なので、1日約 439kcal。僕の最近の運動くらいだ。","ts":"1624335004.484600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"WBfOd"}]},{"client_msg_id":"de3b7a11-806a-4ea8-9eae-3660bc4863e1","type":"message","user":"UD1FQV38V","text":"朝それだけ、つらいな…","ts":"1624334777.484000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8jl"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6705af3d-7404-4cad-9182-2e72163a5ad0","type":"message","user":"U81LLJ340","text":"代謝上げたらぶっ倒れそうな食事だ…","ts":"1624334404.483400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"OR02"}]},{"client_msg_id":"dd27f579-a6fb-4d8a-b819-e45468683ef5","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"```・朝：ウイダーinゼリー＋特茶\n・昼：お弁当＋セブンイレブンでサラダを買い足す\n・夜：フルグラ糖質25%OFF\n※ 夜は18時までにすませて、それ以降は一切食べない```\nこれだいぶ食事制限が影響してますね。","ts":"1624334246.482500","edited":{"user":"U03C6TEAZ","ts":"1624334269.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sugoi","count":4,"users":["U013QL1RAPN","U01BY3SDBRS","UD1FQV38V","UAZ33BKV2"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2EGA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"030e3ede-82fe-4040-a159-4fd70c3afb0b","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"リングフィットを半年以上続けているけど、びっくりするほど体型も体重も一切変わらない。まあそれ以外でほぼ動いていないので、これじゃ全然足りないってことなんだろうけど","ts":"1624331824.482200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"QXjKN"}]},{"client_msg_id":"42e11652-178d-4a8b-9b2b-8855fad578f3","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"実際には食事制限がかなり効いてるんじゃなかろうか","ts":"1624331486.481100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"GxCkK"}]},{"client_msg_id":"acd01cbf-3fd0-4841-92bd-d6d1de5a68f4","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"逆にそんだけ食ってて元の体系なのもすごいが(もっと太い人をしっていると)","ts":"1624331484.481000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/YI"}]},{"client_msg_id":"64cced33-c983-4830-a024-5ec58e54ce60","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"\u003chttps://note.com/chicchi_0411/n/n0d1c38d2653c\u003e","ts":"1624331131.480100","attachments":[{"fallback":"note（ノート）: フィットボクシングをやり続けて3ヶ月で10kgダイエットできた｜Yuki Makino｜note","id":1,"title":"フィットボクシングをやり続けて3ヶ月で10kgダイエットできた｜Yuki Makino｜note","title_link":"https://note.com/chicchi_0411/n/n0d1c38d2653c","text":"ありがとう、フィットボクシング…。やり続けたおかげで、3ヶ月で10kgダイエットすることが出来ました。せっかくなので色々記しておきます。 結論からいうと、3ヶ月でこうなりました。 ■経緯 もともと、ポテチ、コーラ、チョコレート、あま〜いパン、あま〜い飲み物、ハンバーガー、フライドポテト、アイスクリームがめちゃ好きで、毎日そういう類のものをめちゃめちゃに摂取してきました。20代はそんな生活でも全く太らなかったけど、30代後半になると体質が変わって同じようにはいかなくなったみたいで、案の定太ってしまいました。 哀れだ…。人生で最大の太り。さすがにやばいな〜と思","image_url":"https://assets.st-note.com/production/uploads/images/14077198/rectangle_large_type_2_d813b214d116fd97d7580764a956baca.jpeg?fit=bounds\u0026quality=85\u0026width=1280","blocks":null,"service_name":"note（ノート）","service_icon":"https://d291vdycu0ht11.cloudfront.net/nuxt/static/metaicon/apple-touch-icon.png","from_url":"https://note.com/chicchi_0411/n/n0d1c38d2653c","original_url":"https://note.com/chicchi_0411/n/n0d1c38d2653c"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Yp8R"}]},{"type":"message","user":"U023H98P3N0","text":"\u003c@U023H98P3N0\u003e has joined the channel","ts":"1624322330.479100","subtype":"channel_join","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"89AFFEC1-3DBD-4427-81C0-5FD623DFFD0C","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"大事にならなくてよかったですねb","ts":"1624321714.478600","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"desune","count":1,"users":["UAZ33BKV2"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"TBs"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9A7A52A7-3B35-4F7B-9674-DC6BC890AD38","type":"message","user":"U011FTGJ3SN","text":"ただのウィルス性胃腸炎でした、\n白色便は胆管結石とかの可能性もあるみたいだからちょっとビビってた","ts":"1624320550.477500","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"odaijini","count":14,"users":["U013QL1RAPN","U017BU3UZBQ","U7JL1UKKL","U81LLJ340","UDDCM376D","U72TB62UF","UFHQ7TNT0","U782D5DF1","UL6CFN8NR","U7TMPGWJ0","U01BY3SDBRS","U01PMN2BVJQ","U9S4G0LJW","U01J7703PFT"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ZoB"}]}]
